{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b73f3f7cf9d35aa95c7ce221d14a407778309f6709df5f6ce2abb6dd89579968", "ja": "（今日は初詣イベントだ。\nそろそろ集合時間だけど、昴はまだかな？）", "zh": "（今天是初诣活动。差不多到集合时间了，昴怎么还没来？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "d30d5e0297f6b98fe75120ee95822f4c9602a6f80a63ce17a1c0c9d71aa7705e", "ja": "おっす、{$P$}。\nふわぁ……。", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}。\n哈啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1c681d56e539fda47f006f3f13a4490125f55adc9b1102ff7e344b2feefd838f", "ja": "おはよう、昴。ははっ、眠そうだな。\nのり子と初日の出を見に行ったんだって？", "zh": "早上好，昴。哈哈，看起来很困啊。\n听说你和则子一起去看新年的第一缕阳光了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "6f24038880a7afe915d9dec1bbc5ae187fcaa5394f5e5f7015496751492dd452", "ja": "そうなんだよー！　すげー早い時間に迎えにきたと\n思ったら、いきなり連れてかれてさ。", "zh": "就是啊！她大清早来接我的时候，我还以为是什么事，结果突然就把我带走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "0904f9c41ceae0f5b34f8dc53e8c9d23baaaa9d2fd3017fa84b7edf6d631a852", "ja": "ビックリしたけど、すっげー楽しかったぜ！\n{$P$}見てくれた？　送った写真！", "zh": "虽然吓了一跳，但真的特别开心！\n{$P$}，你看到了吗？我发给你的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5d66aa3b5ac3e8b41066f93c2cf7952c101c9e14ba7a165d15407248e78357ce", "ja": "ああ。送ってくれて、ありがとう。\n綺麗な景色だったよ。写真越しなのが残念なくらいだ。", "zh": "啊。谢谢你把照片发给我。\n景色很美。只可惜只能透过照片欣赏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "f82117665c428dbb4c83de03617b757c93f09b9c66e7638ee4f63c1a9634c6e5", "ja": "だろ？　本物みたら、もーっと感動するぜ！\n太陽も海も、メッチャキラキラしててさ！", "zh": "对吧？要是亲眼看到的话，肯定会更加感动的！\n太阳和大海都闪闪发光，特别漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "6f5a657a1e06b2e1dad6a0606a7263aced67524e6e21544ae4c929fd81a736a7", "ja": "朝早くに起こされて、ちょっと寝足りないけど……\n知らない場所に行って、キレイな景色を見てさ。", "zh": "虽然一大早就被叫起来，睡得不太够……\n但去了陌生的地方，看到了美丽的风景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "5ed5f1cabafc3e9912b9a9a8bae9a11fc8689250a3c325c8b25efc13598174b8", "ja": "なんか旅行みたいで、いいよな！\nオレもバイクに乗りたいなーって思っちゃった。", "zh": "感觉就像去旅行一样，真不错啊！\n我也忍不住想骑摩托车了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1009_p", "source_sha256": "59b0d45353b2a0a7d3d032ebdd41f318e8398eb4b90e02d46b856ffad0f4c5ce", "ja": "ははっ、楽しかったみたいでよかったよ。そういえば、\nポケットバイクに乗った時も、昴は楽しそうだったな。", "zh": "哈哈，看起来玩得很开心，真是太好了。说起来，昴骑小型摩托车的时候，也是一副很开心的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "e0cf86425569a2146902989d00fb809539dd10c88745383e1730ac8faf7510a3", "ja": "うんっ！　バイクって、オレに向いてるのかも！\nへへっ。オレ、絶対免許取るからさ……。", "zh": "嗯！摩托车说不定很适合我呢！\n嘿嘿。我一定会去考驾照的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "bf696e7e1343266bf9b687263f749b4f40a0adf85dcbbe842167fb693d72fcb2", "ja": "{$P$}と、初日の出、見に行きたい！\n写真だけじゃ、すごさが伝わらないからな。", "zh": "我想和{$P$}一起去看新年的第一道日出！\n毕竟光看照片，根本传达不出它有多棒啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bcae4da8fda89212d0c5fe69c9f9ea3272052cb9fc88211968715e781a4f352b", "ja": "それは嬉しいお誘いだな。\nけど、一緒に行く相手が俺でいいのか？", "zh": "这是个让人高兴的邀请啊。\n不过，陪你一起去的人是我，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "57b520a7b1f491c1f4516f49fc2b8991a0743ffe180c3769556ff77607fbf1f0", "ja": "当たり前だろ！　写真撮ってる時に思ったんだよ。\n{$P$}がいたらいいのに、って。", "zh": "那当然啦！我拍照的时候就在想呢。\n要是{$P$}也在就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1014_p", "source_sha256": "072efeee326d7cfeb2fa0730e31ca53b9d865503ebbfbd64232c09f352d28155", "ja": "そうか……。昴の運転で、初日の出に\n連れて行ってもらえる日を楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "这样啊……我很期待昴开车带我去看新年日出的那天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0343_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "e32e625e1a7ff33aa9d86c6367e58b9767a4505ee274fad5714a27b8b7759959", "ja": "おう、任せて！　いろんなとこに連れてくから\n期待しててくれよな、{$P$}♪", "zh": "哦，交给我吧！我会带你去很多地方，尽管期待吧，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
